  {
    "comment": "vsroofing declares no blocktype-level blockmaterial \u2014 its roof block defaults to Stone and only sets Ceramic per roof type inside its own attributes, which its RoofBlock class reads at runtime. If it ever applies that to the Block itself, this keeps roofs out of the shatter path; if it does not, the flag is inert. Either way it costs nothing.",
    "file": "vsroofing:blocktypes/roof.json",
    "op": "addmerge",
    "path": "/attributes",
    "value": {
      "rudiments": {
        "unbreakableOnDrop": true
      }
    },
    "dependsOn": [
